<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Космический рубеж — 2D шутер</title>
<style>
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: #05060f;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
